msgid "* Error alerts during installation generally do not prevent the program from working correctly."
msgstr ""
"* Les alertes d'erreur pendant l'installation n'empêchent généralement pas le programme de "
"fonctionner correctement."
msgid "Read before proceeding with the installation:"
msgstr "Lisez avant de procéder à l'installation :"
msgid ""
"Prefer native packages, built for BigLinux, Manjaro, Arch, or other Linux systems compatible with "
"the <span color='#CC2222'>.pkg.tar</span> format.\n"
"\n"
"Another option is to use programs made for any Linux system, usually in <span "
"color='#CC2222'>.run</span>, <span color='#CC2222'>.appimage</span>, or <span "
"color='#CC2222'>.flatpak</span> format.\n"
"\n"
"If the program is not available in the formats above, the <span color='#CC2222'>.deb</span> file "
"can be converted to <span color='#CC2222'>.pkg.tar</span> and installed on this system. However, "
"the installation may not work correctly."
msgstr ""
"Préférez les paquets natifs, construits pour BigLinux, Manjaro, Arch ou d'autres systèmes Linux "
"compatibles avec le format <span color='#CC2222'>.pkg.tar</span>.\n"
"\n"
"Une autre option est d'utiliser des programmes conçus pour n'importe quel système Linux, "
"généralement au format <span color='#CC2222'>.run</span>, <span color='#CC2222'>.appimage</span> ou "
"<span color='#CC2222'>.flatpak</span>.\n"
"\n"
"Si le programme n'est pas disponible dans les formats ci-dessus, le fichier <span "
"color='#CC2222'>.deb</span> peut être converti en <span color='#CC2222'>.pkg.tar</span> et installé "
"sur ce système. Cependant, l'installation peut ne pas fonctionner correctement."
msgid ""
"<big>This system uses the <span color='#CC2222'>.pkg.tar</span> package format, but the file is in "
"<span color='#CC2222'>.deb</span> format.\n"
"\n"
"Do you wish to proceed with the installation?</big>\n"
msgstr ""
"<big>Ce système utilise le format de paquet <span color='#CC2222'>.pkg.tar</span>, mais le fichier "
"est au format <span color='#CC2222'>.deb</span>.\n"
"\n"
"Souhaitez-vous continuer avec l'installation ?</big>"
msgid "Install & Review Config Files"
msgstr "Installer et examiner les fichiers de configuration"
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Installer"
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Fermer"
msgid "Install .deb package"
msgstr "Installer le paquet .deb"
msgid "Converting file, please wait. This may take a few minutes..."
msgstr "Conversion de fichier, veuillez patienter. Cela peut prendre quelques minutes..."
msgid "Done!"
msgstr "Fait !"
